<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n109596" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπόχρῡσ-ος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>containing a mixture</i>
			or <i>proportion of gold,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γῆ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Poll.
					3.87
				</span></i>
			: metaph. of persons, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>R.</u>
				415c
			</span></i>; cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπάργυρος,</span> etc.
			</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>laden with gold, very rich,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔμπορος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hld.
					2.8
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νεανίσκος</span> '<i>gilded
			youth</i>', <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Tox.</u>
				16
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>gleaming with gold,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μῆλα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Philostr.
					<u>Im.</u>
					1.31
				</span></i>
			; <i>gilded,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Men.
				<u>Epit.</u>
				170
			</span></i>; [
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δακτυλίους] σιδηροῦς ὑ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Inscr.Délos</u>
					298.33
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(iii B. C.)</span>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κονδύλιον
			ὑ.</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				442
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>B</u>
				61
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii B. C.)</span>.</div>
